sequenceDiagram
    actor Maker
    actor Checker
    actor Publisher
    participant DraftHTTP as LabelDraftController
    participant AuthContext as ExternalActorResolver
    participant Draft as LabelDraftService
    participant Bind as JdbcReviewTaskDraftBinding
    participant Labels as JdbcLabelDraftRepository
    participant Validator as ValidationApplicationService
    participant HTTP as LabelWorkflowController
    participant Review as LabelReviewService
    participant JDBC as JdbcLabelReviewCommandRepository
    Maker->>DraftHTTP: POST /api/labels/drafts with declarations/task
    DraftHTTP->>AuthContext: resolve existing active context and DEV flag
    AuthContext-->>DraftHTTP: AuthenticatedActor
    DraftHTTP->>Draft: createDraft(product, jurisdiction, entries, task, actor)
    Note over Draft,Labels: Spring transaction owns begin/commit/rollback
    Draft->>Bind: requireFirstDraftAvailable()
    Bind->>Bind: Product lock and current-label/task guards
    Draft->>Labels: createFromCurrentFormula(entries)
    Labels->>Labels: Insert label and USER_ENTERED declarations
    Draft->>Bind: bindOpenTaskToDraft()
    Draft-->>DraftHTTP: Exact LabelDraft
    DraftHTTP-->>Maker: 201 plus Location
    Maker->>Validator: Actual exact-label validation API
    Maker->>HTTP: review-submissions {}
    HTTP->>AuthContext: Resolve existing active context
    HTTP->>Review: submitForReview(labelId, actor)
    Review->>JDBC: lockForReview(), hasPassingValidation()
    Review->>JDBC: pending/task/audit writes
    HTTP-->>Maker: 200 exact LabelDraft
    Checker->>HTTP: review-decisions APPROVE
    HTTP->>AuthContext: Resolve connected checker context
    HTTP->>Review: recordDecision(labelId, decision, comments, actor)
    Review->>Review: Permission, transition and MakerCheckerPolicy
    Review->>JDBC: Label/task/ApprovalRecord/audit writes
    HTTP-->>Checker: 200 APPROVED exact LabelDraft
    Publisher->>HTTP: task publications with exact labelId
    HTTP->>AuthContext: Resolve connected publisher context
    HTTP->>Review: publishReviewTask(taskId, labelId, actor)
    Review->>JDBC: lockForPublication() with current committed guards
    Review->>JDBC: Supersede/publish/pointer/records/task resolution
    HTTP-->>Publisher: 200 PUBLISHED exact LabelDraft
    Note over Maker,JDBC: On guard failure: no later writes. On write failure: rollback.
